Viktor 15.10.2026: «Я вижу только негатив в реальном смысле аудио выплеска»; «Нахер убирай это слайдерное говно из нашей Студии, но сами адаптации волнового инджеста забери». Measured first on GPU1 (three seeds, Acoustic folk at 1.0 flat and in an arch, the same style): from the fifth music token another song (1 % of the tokens kept), the sound pushed every way at random (above 8 kHz x0.19 to x3.45, the centre of the spectrum -822 to +1203 Hz): no pull toward its genre. The Creator's Sliders, the Engine's Sliders card, the take's and About's lines gone; a prompt or a take that had some says each is not installed and leaves it out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
